        {
          "argument": "PORT",
          "argument_optional": false,
          "detail": "Device/port string or fnmatch-style device pattern passed through SerialPortFinder and the serial backend. An explicit non-pattern string, including digit-only text, is forwarded unchanged; it is not converted to an enumerated device index. Pattern selection uses the first matching enumerated device and ordering is not stable. Backend URL forms retain backend-specific meanings. Reference scope: PlatformIO Core 6.1.18.",
